Ensure compliance with POPIA and all applicable information governance requirements, including oversight of member data privacy, cybersecurity controls, third-party data processors, data-sharing arrangements and incident response protocols;
Coordinate the Scheme's assurance activities including internal audit, external audit, actuarial reviews, compliance monitoring and implementation of assurance recommendations.
